Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ishtaria-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, sudo
Recommends: ishtaria-content, ishtaria-worldgen, postgresql
Description: authoritative world server of the Ishtaria virtual planet
 Ishtaria is a federated, persistent virtual planet of Earth-like size.
 This package runs one world: its simulation, persistence and the
 federation endpoint used to link worlds through portals.
 .
 Ships /etc/sudoers.d/ishtaria-server so the ishtaria user can start/stop/
 restart the systemd unit without a password (used by ishtaria-admin).
